# Local benchmark authority.
# Copy this file to .env and set every value explicitly.
# The Makefile and benchmark CLI provide no fallback participant paths,
# host configuration roots, benchmark selections, or runtime agent names.
#
# Product checkout under test:
# Absolute path to the clean committed Hashmarks checkout whose .venv/bin/hashmarks
# will be benchmarked.
HASHMARKS_BENCH_SOURCE=/absolute/path/to/Hashmarks
#
# Comparison product executable:
# Exact Enola executable to benchmark. PATH lookup is not benchmark authority.
ENOLA_BENCH_EXECUTABLE=/absolute/path/to/enola
#
# Native Codex authority:
# Exact Codex executable plus the explicit CODEX_HOME that owns its model/auth config.
# Selected benchmark MCP subjects are injected ephemerally from their adapters; global
# Codex MCP registrations do not choose the benchmarked Hashmarks/Enola executable.
BENCHMARK_CODEX_EXECUTABLE=/absolute/path/to/codex
BENCHMARK_CODEX_HOME=/absolute/path/to/.codex
#
# Native OpenCode authority:
# Exact OpenCode executable, explicit user/config roots, and exact agent persona.
# The benchmark overlays only subject exposure/tool gating; these values own the
# native model/provider/auth configuration used by the selected agent.
BENCHMARK_OPENCODE_EXECUTABLE=/absolute/path/to/opencode
BENCHMARK_OPENCODE_HOME=/absolute/path/to/home
BENCHMARK_OPENCODE_CONFIG_HOME=/absolute/path/to/.config
BENCHMARK_OPENCODE_AGENT=build
#
# Benchmark definition:
# Repository-relative path to the committed suite that defines tasks, conditions,
# agents, subjects, budgets, and scoring inputs. This is SOURCE CONFIGURATION,
# not an output directory.
BENCHMARK_SUITE_PATH=benchmarks/suites/repository-intelligence/heldout-v1
#
# Campaign runtime/evidence:
# Writable directory OUTSIDE the source tree where this benchmark campaign stores
# cache/, work/, and results/. Use a fresh value for an independent campaign.
BENCHMARK_CAMPAIGN_ROOT=/tmp/agentscookbook-heldout-v1
#
# Harness source:
# Path to the agentsCookbook checkout that owns the benchmark runner code.
BENCHMARK_HARNESS_REPO_ROOT=.
